{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Celtic Thunder Christmas felt like a natural next choice because it connects directly to the Christmas albums I repeatedly listened to.",
    "The Glee Christmas album matched that holiday interest, while Il Volo had a possible connection to the vocal listening I have enjoyed."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Guardians of the Galaxy missed my intent because I was not looking for a film soundtrack on this visit.",
    "Titles such as Lifer, Stages and Number One Hits gave me too little connection to my recent listening to make me want to try them. Adele and Blown Away also did not offer a strong enough reason to choose them today."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seemed to treat a broad interest in vocal music as enough reason to recommend albums without a clear holiday connection.",
    "Hits collections seemed to assume that familiar songs would appeal to me even without a connection to what I had been listening to."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Repeated Christmas listening was my clearest specific pattern, although those interactions were older than my latest album choice.",
    "An album can fit my interests without making me want to choose it now: I would try Celtic Thunder Christmas and leave the other plausible matches for another visit."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my holiday and vocal interests, but several choices stretched those interests beyond what would motivate me to listen today."
}"}
